{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35873","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 一 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生身便在乱离间，遇柳寻花作麽看。\n老去转谙无是事，本来何处有多般。\n长怜蠛蠓能随暖，独笑梧桐不耐寒。\n覆载我徒争会得，大鹏飞尚未知宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}